{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Drowsmith 是一款個人音景工作室，讓用戶混合雨聲、海浪、風聲與噪音，為睡前放鬆、休息或靜心營造合適環境；此 App 現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-120.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>混合專屬放鬆音景</h2>\n<p>Drowsmith 可混合雨聲、海浪、風、樹葉、壁爐及白、粉、棕噪音，逐層調整音量與立體聲位置。用戶可播放預設混音，或自建最多 12 層聲音並保存，亦可錄製或匯入音訊。支援鎖屏播放與控制、15 至 60 分鐘睡眠定時及最後五分鐘淡出，內置聲音與混音可離線使用，且無帳戶、廣告或追蹤。不適用於診斷或治療睡眠障礙。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-103-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-104-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-105-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-106-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-107-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-108-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Drowsmith</li><li>應用類別：Music</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/drowsmith/id6824633517?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.604233+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T12:39:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:29.630735+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:43.446080+00:00","content_hash":"fb50c6f3003298f99e33223b75b88a17a90ba3d9a837dda33269c52723200bf1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}